[I] Extended pickling support for Python objects

[T] cloudpickle makes it possible to serialize Python constructs not
[T] supported by the default pickle module, e.g. lambdas and interactively
[T] defined functions, used by joblib for its process based parallelism.

[U] https://github.com/cloudpipe/cloudpickle

